{"title":"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a Part i","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2a\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2a</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In any isosceles triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3ac37c9fa391eebb9601bfaca8bfbfaabdf5ca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = AC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, the altitude <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> bisects the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/3/7f35fe2c75c113f7cdd2f6c59a1ca76e728c540b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = DC$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a_Part_i&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2a\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a\" title=\"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a\">Problem 2a</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2a\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a_Part_i&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As shown in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/0/d208c214bf282ffd81f5bda7de027cc605436f93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = AC = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"125\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15ce28968754a7ce34595935f04929c46f99d0e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />. Determine the length of altitude <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a_Part_i&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> bisects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e525b776c49bbe7d0ae66cfc7ab8f58f40624e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/5/df53c1dd34ab8345b5b9bcd6804b04d8be0d7eaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = \\frac{BC}{2} = \\frac{14}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"39\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/8/e08af8f3acc34996e3cba566dc970b7ed496ba4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ADB$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> is a right triangle, so we can use the Pythagorean theorem to find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a59234d9cacdbb24f71096ebbfcf785ab4d36e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD^{2} + BD^{2} = AB^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"158\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/c/14c111924aa75fa49c404ffce947be0c54aa37ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD^{2} + 7^{2} = 25^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/a/afab51fd7e515cc6bd3d698e723a8a519dee2689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD^{2} + 49 = 625$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/d/96d6abc89e37a741021cda02c2dc2e5c2347e733.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD^{2} = 625 - 49 = 576$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> must be positive, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc335addfa1d5d5d01a5ad3b12bdc43e288e19c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = \\sqrt{576}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d2cca89d5aa7ed0a9130ce403b8bf8a23a869c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017224815\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 101/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1111/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4227/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   19.866      1 -total\n 69.07%   13.721      1 2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\n 30.36%    6.032      1 2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a\n 27.41%    5.445      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36990:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017224815 and revision id 285899. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}